{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6eeeaebee62f8757b3db0812e9f3c6a460de34f377fd47f9f521b3e187c0a4fb",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a88dc8cd9db1efb003cbe293116b612a79f36887b536d465e6d24307232c932b",
      "text": "重逢的DREAM",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aff66a01a671c2de25b4ed053b0d54aa6e6ad83b49dcd663bf160689cef46f97",
      "text": "找到了315 Production试镜的三人。\n在类“欲速则turn”的催促下，由于道夫有约在先未能同行，\n类与次郎便先去事务所侦察，然而……\n类和次郎不知为何却身处百货商场。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_a:cmd-000016:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3a0c7f8f83c9759bf38e90e810580beff52236c88683724b5c13d354d17d97d",
      "text": "第3话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_a:cmd-000016:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a88dc8cd9db1efb003cbe293116b612a79f36887b536d465e6d24307232c932b",
      "text": "重逢的DREAM",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_a:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481",
      "text": "翌日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_a:cmd-000027:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:128ba3253b56eedfd92fd27247193a4a53de3e5a1bbed1709539db08438162b1",
      "text": "次郎的家",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6577bc4c411ea75876fc6ff0694a2e58137d9a28776093b002c350de4ad073fc",
      "text": "（“这家事务所，我和类先去看看。\n硲先生也来吗？”……发送）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5284ebaee786656a423c261daf172c41884010c8786f979232c2a42a1ecb3a7",
      "text": "（“抱歉。今天有事”吗。哎呀呀……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_a:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c32db637b2ddaae290ef937b5a67994eb26629572c97443141a6bccb0fc3d605",
      "text": "Mr. 山下，准备好……\n啊，你跟Mr. 硲contact过了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_a:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:044337177979b8cb7fd3479ab87b942d5f6c23251655896e2d9a72fcc09ad3b0",
      "text": "是啊，说了那家事务所的事。\n顺便一提，他说今天有事来不了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_a:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f4a56dc19e04daf54de5749a90e4389f7e50dffcbd3ed12d02ef8820609f10e",
      "text": "既然这样，今天就我们两个人，\n向着315 Production let's go吧☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_a:cmd-000118:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4567e5076c5c769b9c93a3281e829c026a5d875225c49aca05afd15aca16d5aa",
      "text": "百货商场入口",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_a:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87c52c610dec162775e328c906d5ba4726506d0662948907c9c00c4a42f10db0",
      "text": "……那个，类？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_a:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7020fa54c2ad4457b8f294493c3847bbcc85ae242d344f279f8ff0bd813bcc1",
      "text": "我们为什么会在这里？\n不是说好去315 Production的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_a:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4795e1ebd481a536fa9f7aabb61e37a04362165763e0e4e106c7184e821d9e9",
      "text": "咦？因为要当偶像的话，\n闪闪发光的cool演出服是必须的嘛☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_a:cmd-000150:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ed8b38386e32caa6f0c8b4cd4d6fe9d370db5d648813c1a840273d36108eaba",
      "text": "我昨天跟Mr. 山下说过了对吧？\n还是说那是dream呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_a:cmd-000161:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:754ed2ce050c8a6a88bc00363fd4a50e6322f6d62485f54b3db19778dff6ad37",
      "text": "原来那不只是单纯的梦话啊……\n算了，那就顺便逛逛看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c289739af1a1492b1505fa4fbf14321f45a03583105b50b2d72be3be87127123",
      "text": "这、这双鞋的价格……个、十、百……\n数了多少遍标签上写的都是六位数啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ee3a6fd8d86fcf066d5c243f5962b8d11043f70e212e99a742ea9c02aba5b3c",
      "text": "无论是哪一件，都是我平时穿的衣服的好多倍吧？\n根本买不起买不起。手头的钱根本不够。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9544a35d47da35fd7f4c6edf6462e4d5a5b190a2f490af562d7ab51c5e8f2d9",
      "text": "难道说……当了偶像之后，\n每天都得穿这么贵的衣服吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98bdc425afdf7e120ace3e01317076ea9d912fd98428ed058325b7a6df280643",
      "text": "Mr. 山下，come on！\n给你介绍一下，我high school时代的friend☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:823372f11d4a3454fe1037aa368ee9c7a8ec899c620931186981d736d854896c",
      "text": "他在这里当店长哦。\n一起让他帮我们挑选演出服吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_b:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ad196493b659ec1401c9ce9f038ec86578d0e25017ebc13c653dcc1c4e7654b",
      "text": "啊～你好，初次见面。\n我和他在同一所学校当过老师，我叫山下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_b:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e92b034822dc3f499c8f060b79f5d060d3c28f8a28d41c5e515a8f1065c11d81",
      "text": "啊，初次见面！……等等，我都听说了哦舞田。\n听说你把教师的工作辞了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_b:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c2a7023af8b1efd92f048596ec03b08c8f2ae22c706c4882ab76eb368ac5b40",
      "text": "你的举动真是一如既往的出人意料啊。\n而且今天还说什么“需要演出服”……是要干什么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_b:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a0496800a151fe94127a0fb4a63c659cecf795db35edf99b843f14289508389",
      "text": "呼呼呼……其实呢，我们这次要成为idol了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bce9c58d61ba00612587a5af98cda571e77a2fcafc3a09657386de3cfb2549a",
      "text": "不，准确地说，是正打算要当。\n想要找一件适合试镜的惹眼的衣服～这样……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c2f88b591d25ecd5e5cfe7f415b8aef2e3cb5d487a9c51379173d547fb0274d",
      "text": "偶、偶像！？\n那……那不是正适合你的职业嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84f9ae6441cb841f37832d58ddf9e3dfaa36d4cf297b7d7d2e93e12858cad1f9",
      "text": "既然是这样的话，待会儿也顺便去去我朋友开的\n这家店吧。地点在……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_c:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5756ea3d2132dfa905b3dde57eea029b6f8093c911b118b176fc832ad9dc385",
      "text": "Hi☆ 经人介绍过来的……\n哎，你是那家伙的roommate啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_c:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40cf33c291fdca6c5d987ae4f179a49838d64c759ba3158b544bb39a79de8d11",
      "text": "而且你的friend也开了shop吗？\n也愿意介绍给我……谢谢你☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_c:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab81280c5de38e92bfee79d04e0baae8b863d1ec1e3747cfac8c14d66ab7752d",
      "text": "真的呢，这条皮带看起来style超棒！\n多亏了你的帮忙，帮大忙啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_c:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:370717103e914a0b3f52fc3ac9d68f119a70865f7bb1bf4ae5fc07dd231cfe86",
      "text": "既然是我friend的friend，\n那从今天起我们也是friend啦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_c:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0f2a86a83821a3be4f91baeca367d2a3255ecd7d2134fa2f44c63457fc499ef",
      "text": "（类这家伙，每到一个地方朋友就多一个。\n能跟任何人立刻打成一片，真是一种才能呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_c:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c108b2176f7b41170027a8e94daf78732c83b7172dd0047343ba5138195476b9",
      "text": "（说起来，刚作为新任教师调过来的时候也是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_d:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8761fd089f1f5ee9952b153adbe1c00c8701bd71b3fadf9c6119dc0e20b74e6",
      "text": "从今天起负责english的舞田类哦☆\n我是这所school的毕业生。请多指教啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_d:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26dd5aa59aaaec03c4d43a996ac6bbead98a90bfdf64be226ce4ca9443713804",
      "text": "老师——我根本没打算离开日本，\n一点都不想学英语啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_d:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c9dd1439974a40bbaabaa94c86d55ae5120cc6bd6ab757147e5d6f9afcce318",
      "text": "是吗？但即便如此，\n我还是觉得记住english比较好哦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_d:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03244f9bb05b8d3f914d6da88839c6d3058f921d369421110e9f1b1fad7be106",
      "text": "被外国人搭话的时候，\n能用英语交谈不是very cool吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_d:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0084a68fd2318de384f59f3eca4424c0c6cd8a5068fee4120fd8c6f76baba35",
      "text": "说不定还能借此成为friend呢☆\n我当初就是这样哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_d:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5a19cb76f8d64571d54cb39ef803ec27d7440904dce92b6a4b0e35a6fcaa367",
      "text": "（那位是……新来的英语老师，来着？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_d:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f96d666f9353e07a96b009e809424099f535d918a1a453a7f5daac9e688cde6",
      "text": "（感觉活力满满又前卫的气场超强，\n跟我像是生活在不同的世界一样）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_d:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:590f6da63c1ef015f2bedfc27084f9f2bbf22bdb01bc7b030b0f32e08c838a3a",
      "text": "（嘛，跟我没关系就是了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_e:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:797de48fcf6758576c6239c7c43d69ba40279f4f8961014659decbd45085a4e6",
      "text": "Mr. 山下！今天的lunch，\n一起吃吧。和Mr. 硲三个人一起☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_e:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4da80487a50dbdc7498ee0414862230e55576c1da27635f94eb02156e6f4ae81",
      "text": "哦，类，来得正好！……硲先生。\n不好意思，能借我点午饭钱吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_e:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4487acd3abcc510635351717848a6b6584c9a00814069c4565be03d13bca3ca1",
      "text": "又来了吗，山下君……真拿你没办法。\n一顿午饭钱的程度我还是能借你的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_e:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a62c17bac783b8d920858d2d71dfe1aceb53548e067c19d0018ed6f5aa85d0f",
      "text": "……今天课堂上打瞌睡的学生也很显眼呢。\n到底该怎么做才能让他们集中精力听课呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_e:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9571c6115faa3c9610d4f40d47c2956234b3369be21054d79b45f6c3f2d8408e",
      "text": "Umm……上一堂没有sleep闲工夫的课怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_e:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:012e46cc5de4a4f1cfd9930e636cd3a96199472afa153a79cac2a779388780cc",
      "text": "怎么说？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_e:cmd-000175:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:242388c6f4a6364cc734d49d9e2ece927624403c9b37e3ec7c8b7022de237406",
      "text": "办得像个快乐的party一样！\n开心的话就不会犯困了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_e:cmd-000182:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4389a49c4b68f68f0ae2972e423baf88500a62551efc1e1a224ef59f92ab2443",
      "text": "想营造出Funny的感觉的话，\n推荐胡子glasses哦☆ 啊，不过……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_e:cmd-000195:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6aba429f89a901dd9a211db5faf4f8c29b85a50bd30072fc6407a14dc1fd5f8f",
      "text": "如果是Party的话，必须把整间教室好好decoration一番才行。\n要搞的话我来帮忙♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_e:cmd-000202:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5201a303bf8b231d52927386c670715e23593d0531720b99391d15be9fb42e7",
      "text": "……你总是能提出我想都想不到的方案呢。\n感谢你，舞田君。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_f:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2434ef2ef2fcc0bed55b739cb8fa01199588020ab7a56f98eb71ccf8341b7176",
      "text": "（不知不觉间，就变成了会一起吃午饭、\n有什么事就一起去喝一杯的关系了呢……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_f:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59688ce4336cb9df8a5e56a52cf2a53e99a21a2a4c47817cd9f98b85d8587af5",
      "text": "Mr. 山下，sorry。聊得太入迷了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_f:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee1dbbcefa91e717cc594e4eb4f9c4d8db977bbcf8ac697221dc7dd0029d6198",
      "text": "……类你啊，不管什么时候看起来都很开心呢。\n当老师的时候也是，辞职的现在也是。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_f:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e70ae24ab6f790b38d92b10861cbd0a1cece1a56c13860e58ea67323220b47d3",
      "text": "嗯！嘛，虽然当教师的时候也很开心啦……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_f:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68d24dee881be73e07c8392112b96bc2e5e1448bd91893950582896da65c6f67",
      "text": "但三个人要是成了偶像，\n每天一定会变得更开心、更exciting哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_f:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1decb64814d1d2a7ff207084756eb5adbe667978c89eff63d1184c74fdffe5eb",
      "text": "这就意味着life会变得更加happy对吧？\n呵呵，我很期待成为偶像呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_f:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:203037f3aabc032fbba70d52eef43b1c504698829689d40774de8d2f7c79dba4",
      "text": "好啦，Mr. 山下！差不多该向着重头戏的\n315 Production let's go了☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_f:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3f5cba1c3eb2d9d36d9c1c2228977b460a1ab0a4595af7db40a40dd2f3c9100",
      "text": "是啊，绕路就到此为止……\n哈！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_f:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4aa1d928c6883bb709739590171f01c32918e98229da5f488fbbfb568f0f3f2",
      "text": "好的，前几天真是太感谢了！\n之后我会寄资料给您的，可以的话下次也……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_f:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4749d030006fad753dbc5451b85797bc47f19a28acb2962728f2152959cfbdf",
      "text": "（那、那个人……那个背影是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_f:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:195b89c64c4b7cad26f5b861b95b769e69236d6fc88ce03f5320bbbcd7658f14",
      "text": "（之前在赛马里猜中了大冷门的幸运儿！？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_g:cmd-000022:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45dec9d16b87094c1d28d3c9eebe12b00406f6da320901464ae67c9664bc042b",
      "text": "道夫的家",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_g:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f00a7a6ac8932ca5847915eedd6e5280f22e659465ca68aa188f158e9bd0d002",
      "text": "所以……道夫，怎么了？\n听说有要紧事要谈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_g:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46a3e6604825702a8bc776a6fe8f8a530152ff068778f82472a99a652c164202",
      "text": "今天百忙之中抽出时间，非常抱歉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_g:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1cd1c00d3441a901a45f154b7e3908e175f305c3484c9777c17d80e15be376b3",
      "text": "我有重要的事情想向您汇报。……父亲。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_g:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6a25355728b80acc00a8e80078ddee9320873e48f1102c9e4747a549dc10744",
      "text": "……没事，说吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_g:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2644bca61b04197760df3bde8c0bba846625caadd27841f21be64d547b390293",
      "text": "……前些天，我把教师职务辞了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_g:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7936b86fbbba815ed120bb3b69f305db54ede7db411321d17ce961dd535ed10",
      "text": "我从小就觉得，自己像父亲一样\n成为一名教师是理所当然的事情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_g:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2d259d243ad68709913631080b7afb97e3f7b58ba0cf6aa80e3f257d8bc49cf",
      "text": "没有任何怀疑，\n只是一味地追赶着您的背影。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_g:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c01078c394d4da4ab704207dc88103a97c1e7843d7a8b5431674c399e69a8c9b",
      "text": "但如今，在我的心中……\n萌生了作为教育者的全新理想。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_g:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d1662e8d104e0e6765adccf752819257dbd3207ee2daea16673ddc03a2a9855",
      "text": "我想要去追求这份理想，这个梦想。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_g:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0341625778b1c2e0ead2a364b1417826ebc55db67ea728820c3d29db34e2e1da",
      "text": "那到底是……一种怎样的教育者？\n不是教师吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_g:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1601668e689a6ec525ef32d465b76565fc599c19f2f78d8a0e5eff773f6c0bc",
      "text": "是偶像。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_g:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c216b0d18d2e794a22d974da1e6b46457a7b8cd08aef51fa0cb260a5eff4307",
      "text": "我想成为偶像，\n引领年轻人走向未来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_h:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:951618704ea818009f0a9071c590b89d7887ede7ba0b0f4fad9533be48961a43",
      "text": "（果然没看错！只要让那个人帮我猜赛马，\n我今后岂不是……一辈子吃穿不愁了！？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_h:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1fd63bd0a4fcf4e61e35a0d7730ffe16ef726f352a3d78e940246a15be751264",
      "text": "（等等，我在想什么呢……\n不，但是，这种机会可不多见啊～……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_h:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af3d5e85beb011f34b3ce6525ab4ef9c2c41f96887495672005115ccb37192fc",
      "text": "Mr. 山下？怎么了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_h:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78f7719d0868d674a9df7fbb1472b7c9474cd116c786e65d639010049b776e33",
      "text": "啊，没什么……\n幸运之神……大笔金钱的味道……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_h:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2dd674c21cc763550361268c72aa1e094a00e9b1dbff9e5feef648e9ccb6484",
      "text": "咦，big money？在哪里？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_h:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e55dc7f65ffd9c963cae7eb219228e36d401946d06f1232c4197c1d452b37d08",
      "text": "啊，抱歉抱歉，没什么啦。\n是我看错了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_h:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71c0f1118f6184c34a85621db571955cd3f00d579a3a698838a0f903dc8c1d46",
      "text": "差不多该去事务所了吧？\n那就走吧，快走快走！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_h:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f5c4bd8f44e8bf8335c9ea296b18e28689219a82b38c09772dcec983d9c3b0e",
      "text": "（跟着那个人的话，说不定能轻松拿到巨款。\n但我已经决定要三个人一起当偶像了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_h:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ebe6ce845de372c8db80c9c503280f7be6672504023eecb43579b8946065fbc",
      "text": "（比起那个，现在我更想把赌注压在硲先生的热情，\n还有类所说的快乐生活上呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_h:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3aff8305ed41330eea226bb73cd57dc63282498e049a5a5a24458dc0621b5cd1",
      "text": "再见啦。我的幸运之神……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_i:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eca7c150a93d76a933dbcd78bd2419323d2137484f6e806f504c0966d6e986a6",
      "text": "哎哎～……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_i:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab1a3fb7f9a11ef190cd733a17ff119bdb8cf3113ba159e72b14025d796f6318",
      "text": "What？Mr. 山下，怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_i:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b8ef7d8a200abd3fcbcec70ce3076629d2cd63fd707139d100d4fabed8f86b2",
      "text": "啊，没有……\n稍微有点……怎么回事呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_i:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e8c0740536d455d82d505a435175f7a0d5779d8fce7a65d987d75394dd49415",
      "text": "（走在前面的，又～是幸运之神吧？\n刚才明明才刚甩开的，不是开玩笑吧？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_i:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd708fe35465dbc28159964425891f49e63f7008d4f7147dcac98ac2263d9ded",
      "text": "类。赶紧离开这里，快点走吧。\n不然的话，我的决心会动摇的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_i:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6edcae7d4151d26ac49392a37bffe42fa42f2c6e07c89511308b2e5d4740660",
      "text": "别这样……等等……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_i:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb0f34468c56967322751129a56fbc9168e906710dbe1614e3b3b184737af4da",
      "text": "（怎么又在啊！为什么会三番五次地出现？\n难道某种测试已经开始了吗！？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_i:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58002c6dce85f58ae675a96ec849a17dca96aa873a2321830be283c58bfa5811",
      "text": "喂喂，是贤君吗？\n……嗯，我马上就回那边去！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_i:cmd-000164:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dbb920434fd928544b95c05fc7b71349f894e08a1cb8a167148a460f29b7f20a",
      "text": "（在说什么啊！？下场比赛的赛马预测吗！？\n拜托了，不要再诱惑我了啦～～！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_j:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c09b54a6b1f74265c462120674c54e58e028e0b3ad0113a4da95e66b490793d0",
      "text": "Mr. 山下，是不是那栋大楼？\n315 Production的事务所所在的大楼！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_j:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d987299356b999712bdc0041846503405202660b78d302b3d4f9ce06f7145b4",
      "text": "哈、哈……终于到了吗？……等等，咦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_j:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc66694f4604f8eb9f9e91e4f2a89d0448e500ad5bbd6ddd4a79a7fc39c9a2fe",
      "text": "（正要走进同一栋大楼……\n这么说来，难、难道说……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_j:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc1f7403b49e306f9c4d9ba55efa23e42880b6a875bc28bf392a69151eef67d8",
      "text": "那个，不好意思，那边的神仙……\n不对，那边的人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_j:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f16cebe64a4ce57285ae114709fea368dc6fcb1b7d9188084d711113b78b105e",
      "text": "你是315 Production的，相关人员吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_j:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26abc5509d2590998fdababd49ef0142fa870e4b37563b1d7523444434dee2c0",
      "text": "是的。请问有什么……咦？\n您不是前些天在电器街见到的……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_j:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffc81b86b141dfa3412e499d9db243b6ad206116084a8460a92c31ef9c7592e7",
      "text": "是的，当时多谢了。\n……原来如此，目的地是一样的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_j:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1dfbad04fb08ba8079122fc620e7b7af4771ed1ff4359e2497fbad439e965925",
      "text": "啊！这本杂志是偶像情报杂志吧。\n难道说，您对偶像有兴趣……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_j:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c57b763e79abfbc67582b286d5ce9308b1be49b48a2e7f49048d2b171277d174",
      "text": "Yes！我们是看了这本magazine找过来的☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_j:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a84ff625ff63e4541529e467fab1dc28d2fb641b5d0ba37f668f3c030ac5f06",
      "text": "既然是这样的话，请进里面吧。\n请务必让我和二位详谈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_j:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffd8a9ee1c7e5875439a2bd2d0f01565d224cb92710a7868268e851632c85aeb",
      "text": "能遇到事务所的人……\n今天真是lucky不断呢，Mr. 山下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_j:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2042ec89bfd41d20e015dd594d682403ab9c98d24a6e267f5f8764faaa096be6",
      "text": "是啊……大叔我已经心跳加速喘不过气来了。\n到底能不能……好好听进去呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
